y": "Thank you very much for your wonderful illustrations the other day.\n\n\nHeart Catch Pretty Cure! Please send me an illustration of Erika Raikai's whole body immersed in ice.\nShe is playing at a campsite when an enemy appears, and before she can transform, she is put on ice.\nThe setting is a gravel road on the border between a river and a plain, where she stands with a stunned expression on her face as a permanent ice sculpture, standing there all winter long.\nI would like the feet to be blue sandals, in addition to the following attire.\n\nReference for clothing and facial expressions↓.\nhttps://x.com/daisukiinorin/status/1875478829722169710?t=4UuDsPH05VtGA7xsLtvYSA&s=19", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@wagashi425/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2146247, "client_id": 2214027, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8dc6146b/uploads/origins/3c190563-d048-4718-a972-cfb35b367943?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=472819e6663a42c21a9e554112668e8e", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8dc6146b/uploads/origins/3c190563-d048-4718-a972-cfb35b367943?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bd05be11a4e544b3a14e157e7b6c47d0", "src_set": ""}, "body": "I saw your artwork of Shampoo, and was wondering, is Shampoo and Ukyo from Ranma 1/2 as mermaids an acceptable idea? Some pose references are below \n\nPose references:\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1002232091032952962/1056781540769677332/merfaye2.png?ex=67dc39c1&is=67dae841&hm=4cfd7aa1b4055b2ea2619336c317528178f459fa2f9be08cbb6d4cd9a3182991& \nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1002232091032952962/1056781638643753010/PokeMermaids.png?ex=67dc39d8&is=67dae858